  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Well Spell. Exploit nearest corpse or sacrifice 66% health to create a Well of the Profane at its location. For 8...18...20 seconds, foes in that area are stripped of all enchantments and cannot be the target of further enchantments. (50% failure chance with Death Magic 4 or less.)",
      "zhTW": "利用最近屍體，或犧牲 66% 體力，建立泉井。持續 8～20 秒，區域內敵人失去所有加持，且不能成為新加持的目標。死亡魔法 4 點以下有 50% 失敗率。"
    },
    "pvp": null
  },
